# Subtest: an adherence task with a topic, with an inline list, or with stored-document ids validates; one whose only source is an empty topic or an empty list does not, a non-empty override with an empty list beside it still validates, one with the removed constraintsSource does not, and for constraintsSource the message says to give constraintTopic instead, also in a generic plan that holds the docs task and also beside a usable override
ok 936 - an adherence task with a topic, with an inline list, or with stored-document ids validates; one whose only source is an empty topic or an empty list does not, a non-empty override with an empty list beside it still validates, one with the removed constraintsSource does not, and for constraintsSource the message says to give constraintTopic instead, also in a generic plan that holds the docs task and also beside a usable override
  ---
  duration_ms: 225.243125
  type: 'test'
  ...
